WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.211
The thing that lights up
when you push the button.

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:07.215
And behind him he saw… You know?

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:13.680
A long-haired woman wearing one of those
"I can just throw it on" outfits.

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:16.558
But something wasn't right.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.978
Her height was… How tall was it?

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:23.398
You know?
As tall as&nbsp;an NBA player, you know?

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.984
Then the next thing they knew,

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:28.028
she was on all fours like… You know?

00:00:28.069 --> 00:00:30.905
Like an animal?
Anyway, just crazy, you know?

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.241
Then, crash!

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.493
The next thing they knew, it was morning.

